       "problem": "Solve √(x + 3) = x − 3.",
       "steps": [
        {
         "text": "Square both sides: x + 3 = x² − 6x + 9."
        },
        {
         "text": "x² − 7x + 6 = 0 → (x − 1)(x − 6) = 0 → x = 1 or 6."
        }
       ],
       "answer": "Check x = 6: √9 = 3 and 6 − 3 = 3 ✔. Answer: **x = 6**."
